# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form — email delivery
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Web3Forms is the recommended backend: free forever (250 submissions/month),
# no credit card, no account. Get a key by entering your email at
# https://web3forms.com/#start — it arrives by email in seconds.
#
# The key is PUBLIC by design (Web3Forms documents this): it is only an alias
# for your inbox and is inlined into the client bundle like any VITE_* value.
# Keeping it here is tidiness, not secrecy.
#
# Set this and the form delivers straight to the inbox, on localhost and live.
# Leave it unset and the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# Optional alternative backend — any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST of
# { name, email, message }: Formspree, Getform, a Cloudflare Worker, etc.
# Only used when VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY is empty.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vite base path. Defaults to "./", which works for GitHub Pages project pages,
# Docker/nginx at the root and Cloudflare Pages alike. The Pages workflow sets
# this to /<repo-name>/ automatically.
# VITE_BASE=/my-portfolio/
